  "sourceTitle": "Hot Sauerkraut",
  "sourceText": "Hot Sauerkraut\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 17, 2009 - 12:42am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 tablespoons Fat or butter\n3/4 cup Diced onions\n1 1/2 pounds Sauerkraut drained\n1/4 teaspoon Pepper\n2 teaspoons Paprika\n1 teaspoon Sugar\n1/2 cup Water\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Melt the fat in a saucepan and brown the onions lightly. Add the sauerkraut, pepper, paprika, sugar and water. Cover loosely and cook over low heat 1 hour. 2 Serves 4 to 6.",
